msgid "Telemetry data is published via MQTT directly to our high-performance Elixir broker. Updates are broadcasted instantly to your dashboard LiveView."
msgstr "Telemetriedaten werden via MQTT direkt an unseren leistungsstarken Elixir-Broker gesendet. Aktualisierungen werden sofort an Ihr Dashboard-LiveView übertragen."

#: lib/dtu_app_web/controllers/page_html/privacy.html.heex:76
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Telemetry readings are stored indefinitely so your historical charts keep working; you may delete them individually from each DTU's settings page."
msgstr "Telemetriewerte werden unbegrenzt gespeichert, damit Ihre Verlaufsdiagramme"
